graph Chen {graph [rankdir=LR,overlap=false,splines=spline,nodesep=0.24,ranksep=1.0,pad=0.4,bgcolor=white,label="ASignX Entity Relationship Model - Chen notation
23 application entities plus external Supabase identity
Rectangles: entities | Diamonds: relationships | Ovals: attributes | Underlined: primary key
Endpoint labels show minimum..maximum participation; composite keys are jointly unique",labelloc=t,fontsize=24,fontname="Arial"];node [fontname="Arial",fontsize=12];edge [fontname="Arial",fontsize=10,color="#718096"];
